{"server":"cn","storyId":"act11mini_level_act11mini_st02","groupId":"act11mini","stageId":null,"title":"后会有期","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11mini/level_act11mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"0778778150174b460629bae14503474b0c92c22b94aff34d8759402c7821ffac","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"离蜀进京前夕，梁洵终于有机会与宁辞秋相约上山喝茶看戏，而杜遥夜、左乐等人也即将各自踏上行程。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大清早的，还有点凉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚蜀这天气，现在嫌凉了，到晌午又热得很，难伺候啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"寒暑需有个度，想来尚蜀百姓早已适应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得是。不过瞧着最近雨水多了，怕是天气要变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望不是什么大寒大暑，给人点时间适应适应。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"季候到了，总有些变节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船家，可否载我一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说，去哪儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"渡江。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。您看您这江，是怎么渡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走哪条道，赶时间不赶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是行得急，时间紧，我便行快船，费不了多少工夫就能到对岸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若我不急又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就得在渡口先整治些酒菜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒在船上温着，船就从上游这渡口，贴着边漂下去。能看到城市，也能瞧见正在种的田，风景好着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听着不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就这么定，我先把酒温上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你倒很会做生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做这行的，总归得有些眼力见儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这样的老丈，没几个不爱多看看这尚蜀城的。就算不看城，也爱看人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说的不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人，确实当看，若不看人，就是白走一遭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵应当与你说过，他今晚便该随我回京。出尚蜀这趟路，便由你指引。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您别怪罪，梁大人这回走得急，我们这些人难免多担忧些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这知府大人......说是了不得的父母官，可到底还年轻着呢，有时候看着就像家里的子侄，让人担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵他有这般才能，也有志气。顶得住，便是功成名就。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是顶不住呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——唉，算了，不该问。您要看看这尚蜀，只管跟我来便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是可惜，鲤小子前头还在找人，我看今天他要见梁大人，是难了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天还有些凉，好在茶是热的，倒也不冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人公务繁忙，今天怎么来得这么早？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说好陪你看戏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多披些衣物，小心风寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候说好了？之前只说，得空了就一起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今日就得空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骗人。太傅交代得那么紧急，工作上的交接就有大堆麻烦......梁大人莫非是昨夜没睡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，有稍微合眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐今天也醒得早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜不听人劝的梁大人今天一早会来，一直在等着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茶杯空了，杯子递给我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一杯茶而已，你我之间还用说谢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能在这山上坐坐，喝茶醒醒神，也不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这儿的茶点味道也挺好......油酥，芝麻糕，还有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糖果子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上回宁小姐夸奖过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，您就记着了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。宁小姐喜欢，就多留意了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚蜀什么都好，就是口味上有点重，好在糕点大多还是香软甜口的，合我的口味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，梁大人府里煮的锅子最初也辣得很，之后倒好了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初动不了一筷子就要找水，太狼狈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"府里解辣的汤时刻备着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐的家乡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"南边水乡，不大吃辣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难为你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么，总归要适应的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话虽如此，这不是轻易能做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有心想要适应，就不难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总归要适应的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人之前提过，您是尚蜀本地人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某人早年离家，近些年才回到故乡。宁小姐知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听你提起过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说来，你的那位龙门朋友，就是在离家期间遇上的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时少不知事，离家闯荡，交了不少朋友，以为少年意气无坚不摧，无所不可为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做了不少贻笑大方的蠢事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交朋友可不算蠢事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，你交的是位好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是梁某幸运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是这次事出紧急，确实该好好请你那位朋友在尚蜀游览一番，尽一尽地主之谊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还能多听两句梁大人的过往趣事，不知道同现在差别大不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从未变过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许还是有些变化。不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某人要做的事，为一方百姓......从未变过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜太傅提出随他上京......我原本，不想应下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怪我替你答应了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时犹豫已经是不应该，我该谢谢宁小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不怪罪我就好了。你放心不下尚蜀，我能理解，其他人也能，但太傅开口是不一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅身边不留庸才。他老人家给出的，只会是最险、最难搏的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想如果我没看错梁洵这个人，那你要是一时犹豫拒绝了，之后一定是会后悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白。让宁小姐担心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没事，没什么。我只是忽然想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那时要是当真毫不犹豫地同意要走，恐怕，我也是要有些生气的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。宁小姐说笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是说笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这才多久，日头就起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，这戏好看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要不要早些下山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......再看一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐，再看一会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，爹！别看了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么啊，这有什么可看的，不就一张行程单嘛，我和其他人都商量好了，等东西收拾好了就出发！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有一屋子的东西没收拾呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急什么，我再看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一群年轻人，决定做得那么急，容易出事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人怎么了？谁还不是从年轻时过来的，爹你年轻时不也天南地北地走镖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能一样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人带着，你们晓得道上哪条路走得，哪条路走不得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这时节出这么趟远门，你可知该带什么，不该带什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时代不同了爹，可别翻您那老黄历了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遥夜！听话，爹能给你说的不多了，这次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你定了要去玉门城，就去吧。我也拦不住你们，不走我们给铺的这条路，没准也是好事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹啊，假如说啊，我就打个比方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我们这客栈不开了，您还有几个叔伯，有没有考虑过和我们一起去玉门城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遥夜啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎爹我就随口说说，我晓得肯定不成的！您就随便听听......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遥夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这客栈本来就是为你留的，你要是不接手，趁早歇业关门也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说要自立门户，我不拦着，我信你是有考虑的，但我还是得给你说两句，你也别嫌爹啰嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给年轻人们牵了头，他们都信你，跟着你，你说时代变了......没错，时代是变了，但这事放在什么时候都变不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然站出来，一呼百应，那往后遇上再难的事，你也不能退，再苦，再累，你得担着，听见没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......知道的，爹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。行了，这单子你拿去，有些不那么好走的路，我给你避开些，能走大道便走大道，那些我们蹚过的泥巴路，你们可别再踩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，难啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就有桩心事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遥夜，你年纪也不小了，这次去玉门城，能不能正经带个小伙子回来看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停，停！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹！瞎操什么心呢！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么是瞎操心了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是瞎操心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不同爹你说了，我还要去一趟梁大人府里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找梁大人作甚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我要找，是那个姓鲤的要找！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他都找不着，可见梁大人应当不在府里，你去又有什么用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有道理。好啊，这姓鲤的又用这招糊弄我！我现在就去找他算账！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘家家的，什么时候才能稳重些哦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别人的家事，不要东张西望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青砚，你现在这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我不是问这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一早就等在这里，阻拦我去见那三位，总得给我一个理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，我会同你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青砚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大呼小叫，像什么样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并非代表大理寺走这一趟，不论官职，你该叫我什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"规矩你是忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小姨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何必总搬出这一套来压我？又不是什么正经的亲戚，你也不过是仗着麟家和我爹相交，长我一个辈分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天师府这次要你走这一趟，到底为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自然是为百姓苍生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好一个为百姓苍生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，真就要放任......真就这么继续下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅已经做下判断，我等遵令即可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你，左乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你入司岁台时日尚浅，这次尚蜀背后所藏之事不简单，现在看来，许多内幕你并不知情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当差却一知半解，荒唐！谁叫你来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无人指派，是我主动请缨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你不相信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信你主动请缨，却也信有人背后作怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我倒是头一次听说，大理寺铁面无私忠直坦白的麟青砚，也学会揣测这些官场阴私了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传闻里你不是最厌烦理会这类蝇营狗苟，要是有人与你聒噪，就要电他个顶盖发麻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今这样，可不是你的风格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的行事风格，不必你提点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我被托付关照你，事关你，自然应当谨慎些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你弹舌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事，小姨听错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待此间事了，你也该同我回一趟京城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊蛰","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是左将军的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。我随你回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礼部左侍郎......其实是个不太参与政务的职位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人有没有听说过，我如今这官职是怎么来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿闻其详。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人靠自己出人头地，这是我比不上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁家......算是个大姓。祖上蒙荫，后人也算上进，一辈辈积累些门路财产，就这么传下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我祖父官至一品，勤勤恳恳几十年，就是我不说名字，梁大人应该也认得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是对着梁大人，我才肯说，不然这话显得像是我要炫耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐......很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不会这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前也和梁大人说过，我在家中同辈的兄弟姐妹里行七。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我父亲那一辈人志不在此，小辈们也是，我最大的堂兄大我十来岁，早已成家立业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖父准备从官场上退下时，正巧我年少气盛，被卷进一个走私贪污的案子，侥幸抓了一串贼人，转天公文就被送到祖父案头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐才干过人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"场面话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢。是真心话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖父那时候单独将我喊去书房，我们没聊什么特别的，他老人家就问了我一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他问：“辞秋，你这一身才学本领，可愿为国、为民、为天下？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就答说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......肝脑涂地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在所不辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐好气魄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，故事就讲到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，茶凉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有些温度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我看梁大人你的手已凉了。要是你乐意我将这披风还你一半，我们倒也不是不能再沏上一壶热茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......身体要紧，披好，别摘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，不信你试试......是不是比你梁洵暖和？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某人手冷，别冻着宁小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天之后，不知要什么时候才有机会再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐要多保重身体，不要贪凉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是宁小姐往后还要赏花，不嫌路途遥远，便不必自己动手，托人带一封信，交给我来种就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，啊，嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你既然都这样说了，那我就也直说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，你兜里那扎了缎带的首饰盒子，还要揣多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，梁大人，难不成那还能是你准备要送给旁人的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顶唔顺啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不该带你来找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不该。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不露面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在露面，不合适吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们这你来我往，简直比台上的戏还精彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁想到这姓梁的......唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，不行，不能算了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁想到这姓梁的，十多年未见，成如今这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十多年未见，不稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在还有茶可喝，有戏可看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么一来，梁洵啊，你可是又欠我一笔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想找老朋友喝最后一杯酒，到底是难咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
